# Atmosphère Package

A customized distribution of [Ultra NX](https://github.com/Ultra-NX/UltraNX), rebuilt from its original source with additional modules and components that are not included in the upstream project.

## Overview

This package is designed to provide a convenient, ready-to-use Atmosphère setup for users who want access to a broader set of commonly used features without having to manually identify, install, and configure individual modules.

The included components are intended to complement the original Ultra NX configuration while keeping the setup straightforward for users who may not be familiar with the purpose or configuration requirements of each module.

## Based on Ultra NX

This project is based on the original Ultra NX source:

**Upstream Repository:**
https://github.com/Ultra-NX/UltraNX

The original project remains the foundation of this distribution. Additional components have been integrated to provide functionality that is not included in the original source.

